            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Messages | Verification, password reset, and workflow notifications |\n"
            "| Delivery | Track provider response separately from recipient delivery |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Send a verification email to a test mailbox.\n"
            "2. Request a password reset and check link expiry and single-use behavior.\n"
