    tags=["storage", "s3", "aws"],
    connections=[],
    info=Info(
        description=Markdown(
            "## Direct upload boundary\n"
            "\n"
            "AWS S3 bucket for user file uploads. The Wasp Server generates pre-signed S3 upload URLs; the client uploads directly to S3. File metadata is tracked in PostgreSQL.\n"
            "\n"
            "> **Illustrative sample notes:** the checks below are design and runbook examples, not claims about an active deployment.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Responsibilities\n"
            "\n"
