            "| --- | --- |\n"
            "| Authorization | Server checks the user before issuing a scoped upload URL |\n"
            "| Metadata | Application records track the object and its owner |\n"
            "\n"
            "### Walkthrough\n"
            "\n"
            "1. Request an upload URL and upload a small test file.\n"
            "2. Attempt to reuse an expired URL and inspect the resulting user feedback.\n"
