            "   - Compare the user-visible outcome with the persisted or provider state.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Failure handling\n"
            "\n"
            "**Watch for:** An uploaded object and its database metadata can be created at different times.\n"
            "\n"
            "Suggested diagnostic signals: *failed uploads, orphaned objects, and metadata reconciliation errors*. Compare them over the same time window.\n"
