            "\n"
            "- [ ] Exercise the happy path with test data.\n"
            "- [ ] Rehearse the failure and recovery path.\n"
            "- [ ] Record the owner, evidence, and follow-up in the deployment runbook.\n"
            "\n"
            "~~Assume a green process means the workflow works~~ — verify the end-to-end outcome as well.\n"
            "\n"
            "### Frameworks and tools\n"
            "\n"
            "- **Framework layers in this sample**\n"
            "  - No web framework is modeled for this component; inspect its service runtime and integration clients instead.\n"
            "- **Example development and investigation toolkit**\n"
            "  - TypeScript for static checks\n"
            "  - ESLint for source checks\n"
            "  - Playwright for browser workflows\n"
            "- **Example observability tools**\n"
            "  - `prometheus`\n"
            "  - `grafana`\n"
            "  - `loki`\n"
            "  - `jaeger`\n"
            "\n"
            "The tool lists illustrate a possible setup for this architecture; they do not install tools or assert that an upstream project uses every listed tool.\n"
        ),
        version=IncrementalVersion.parse("1"),
        languages=[ProgrammingLanguage.typescript],
        deployments=[DeploymentTarget.unknown],
        owners="Product",
        metric_tools=[
            MetricTool.prometheus,
            MetricTool.grafana,
            MetricTool.loki,
            MetricTool.jaeger,
        ],
        links=[
            Link(
                site_name="Analytics Guide",
                http_url=Url("https://docs.opensaas.sh/guides/analytics/"),
            )
        ],
    ),
)

